      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/2845-touching-solids\n\nConflicted files:\n- crates/app/tests/pocket3d_hsm.rs: both sides added a bore pin.\n  This branch moved the Linux x86_64 triple to (3158, 3130, 1141) after\n  the solidcore mesh of PR #2904. Main added the macOS aarch64 arm with\n  the same triple (issue #2371). Keep both arms and both exact-pin tests.\n  The two tests share one helper, cfg-gated to the two pinned platforms.\n\nRefs #2845\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
