      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/2845-touching-solids\n\nConflicted files:\n- crates/app/tests/pocket3d_hsm.rs: by the decided stack-4 resolution\n  (6ea2ccd45). Keep the #2941 comment text of the facet note and the\n  Linux arm. One Linux exact-pin test calls assert_bore_pin_is_exact and\n  also rejects the old truck-mesh triple (4726, 4698, 549). Keep the\n  macOS arm and test. Main's later Windows pin of issue #3050\n  (01e74d74c, not in stack 4) is kept with its value (3158, 3130, 1141).\n  Its exact-pin test uses the same helper and still rejects the old\n  triple (4716, 4688, 549). The helper's cfg now names Windows too.\n\nRefs #2845\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
